    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "LOGICAL_REVIEWER = DUNCAN 3\nMODE = INDEPENDENT SANDBOX\nSTATUS = DESIGN CANDIDATE / IMPLEMENTATION NOT STARTED\nBRANCH = duncan3/salvador-shadow-learning-r01\nDESIGN_HEAD = c1519f457b54caa0bff60f4363e2dc3ccc6a44c3\nSPEC = docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-29-salvador-shadow-learning-r01-design.md\n\nPURPOSE\nFormalize SALVADOR shadow learning as a one-way, read-only observer that learns from authorized success/failure evidence, computes versioned measurements, archives append-only progress events, and reconstructs cross-session training state without mutating production, canon, QC verdicts, prompts, models, workflows, denoise, dimensions, source bytes, or result bytes.\n\nINHERITS\n- #76 Studio Constitution R02\n- #77 SALVADOR Charter R01\n- #93 / #98 training baseline + stress principles\n- #144 HQ Memory + Search vertical architecture\n\nCORE LAW\n`SHADOW LEARNING != LIVE SELF-MODIFICATION`\n`MEASURE BEFORE INTERPRETING`\n`FAIL != ZERO LEARNING`\n`LEARNING CANDIDATE != PRODUCTION LAW`\n`HARD LOCK FAIL OVERRIDES AGGREGATE QUALITY`\n`STATE_NOW = REDUCE(APPEND_ONLY_EVENT_HISTORY)`\n\nMATH\n`K_(t+1) = UPDATE(K_t, E_t)`\n`DeltaK_t = K_(t+1) - K_t`\nSkill states are categorical: UNTESTED / FAILED / PARTIAL / PROVEN / LOCKED. No fake global percentage. LOCKED cannot be self-awarded.\n\nARCHIVE\nCanonical record = `SALVADOR_PROGRESS_EVENT_R01` with source/result hashes, versioned measurements, QC evidence, failures, root-cause hypotheses, learned-rule candidates, before/after skill state, progress delta, next targets, and provenance. RAW/history are immutable; corrections append supersession events.\n\nREUSE\nUse #144 stack/contracts: Pydantic + SQLite + FTS5 + content-addressed artifacts + pytest. sqlite-vec only later behind an interface; DuckDB only later for audit. No new database/search/vector server in R01.\n\nDESIGN GATE\nImplementation must not start until the written spec is reviewed/approved. No production integration before later exact-head verification and independent technical QC where applicable.\n\nMERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_MUTATION = NO\nCANON_MUTATION = NO\nAUTO_PROMOTION = NO",
